      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>The biometric image was too noisy due to suspected or detected dirt on the sensor. For example, it's reasonable return this after multiple BIOMETRIC_ACQUIRED_INSUFFICIENT or actual detection of dirt on the sensor (stuck pixels, swaths, etc.). The user is expected to take action to clean the sensor when this is returned.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/hardware/biometrics/BiometricPrompt#BIOMETRIC_ACQUIRED_IMAGER_DIRTY" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.hardware.biometrics.BiometricPrompt.BIOMETRIC_ACQUIRED_IMAGER_DIRTY</code>.</a></format></para>
